Z||000010||Monkeyman||01-17-2001||04:45 PM||||Uanaa--Some guy in the Lost Wages (Las Vegas) area bought the molds and the rights to the dash.  Eddie Snaaw was the Dutchman (is that a word, Cliff?) who built the original.  I have the name, address and email addy of the purchaser.  Unfortunately, it's on my PC which is currently under the weather (and if I can't get it working soon, it'll be under my car).  If I can recover my data, I'll post the info for you.  The purchaser said that he was going to make some minor adjustments/mods to it, then begin to mass produce it.  The timetable he gave me would have had it produced a few months ago.  Looks like it may have just been a rich kid who wanted a one off dash.  Bummer.||||reg||1
